        <name>EDF_HSM_EMPTY_SIGNAL</name>
        <initializer>((EDF_event_signal_t)0U)</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Internal framework reserved signals for HSM management. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The order and numeric values of these signals are important and tightly coupled to the HSM implementation.</para>
<para>Forces a state handler to return its superstate.</para>
<para>This signal must never be handled explicitly. It always falls into the default case of the state switch and returns <ref refid="edf__hsm_8h_1ae1fb8c5035fbfadf1aa6807fd1149f06" kindref="member">EDF_HSM_RET_SUPER(super)</ref>. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
