        <name>EDF_HSM_ENTRY_SIGNAL</name>
        <initializer>((EDF_event_signal_t)1U)</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Entry action signal. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A state may implement this handler to perform its entry action. The only valid return is <ref refid="edf__hsm_8h_1a356c0d8eb8c95289794b66efc56f8544" kindref="member">EDF_HSM_RET_HANDLED()</ref>. If no entry action exists, no handling of the signal should be implemented. </para>
